# C — public financial figures by fiscal year, from each year's Form 990 (Part I summary, Part IX and Part X), US dollars,
# accrual basis. Exact numbers as filed; a figure the return does not give is left out, never estimated.
# The nonprofit changed its fiscal year in 2024: calendar years to 2023, then a six-month short year (January to June 2024),
# then July-to-June years. `employees` is the return's count of individuals employed in the calendar year it names;
# `volunteers` is the return's own estimate. Both are counts, not people.
